# Formal equivalence: original netlist vs fanout-replicated netlist.
#
# WHY THIS AND NOT tb_encrypt_equiv.v
# -----------------------------------
# The existing testbenches compare `encrypt_4encrypt` against
# `mx_encrypt_4encrypt`, which has extra ports (clk2x, phase_d) for the mux2
# pipeline transform. Fanout replication has no such interface change: the two
# netlists are the same design, same top, same ports, differing only by 22
# added cells and ~2054 rewired load connections.
#
# That makes formal equivalence both applicable and stronger than simulation --
# it proves the transform is functionally neutral rather than sampling it.
#
# WHAT IS BEING PROVED
# --------------------
# replicate_fanout_placed.py clones a driver and moves a subset of its loads
# onto the clone. Sound in principle: a clone with identical inputs computes
# the same value every cycle. verify_replication.py already checked that
# invariant STRUCTURALLY (identical input connections, fresh singly-driven
# output net, loads only ever moved from the original). This checks it
# SEMANTICALLY, which also catches anything the structural test's assumptions
# missed.
#
# NOTE ON EXPECTED DIFFICULTY
# ---------------------------
# equiv_make pairs up cells by name and looks for equivalence points. The
# replicas are new names with no counterpart in the gold design, so their
# outputs are the interesting points -- each replica's Q must be provably equal
# to the original driver's Q. equiv_simple should discharge these quickly since
# the cones are identical; equiv_induct is there for anything sequential that
# needs induction over state.
#
# Run:  yosys -s equiv_replication.ys

# Post-synthesis JSON references LUT2/FDRE/RAMB18E1 etc. Without the Xilinx
# simulation library those are undefined blackboxes and prep aborts with
#   ERROR: Module `LUT2. referenced in module `am01_qmtech_top.
read_verilog -lib +/xilinx/cells_sim.v
read_json out_nm1_nosr/am01_qmtech_top_vy40.json
prep -top am01_qmtech_top
design -stash gold

read_verilog -lib +/xilinx/cells_sim.v
read_json out_nm1_nosr/am01_qmtech_top_vy40rep2.json
prep -top am01_qmtech_top
design -stash gate

design -copy-from gold -as gold am01_qmtech_top
design -copy-from gate -as gate am01_qmtech_top

equiv_make gold gate equiv
prep -top equiv
opt_clean

equiv_simple -seq 5
equiv_induct -seq 5
equiv_status -assert
